  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Water is Health Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project is designed to improve access to clean water for rural community at Mambilla plateau through drilling of local borehole with a surface tank and distribution pipes powered by a solar energy in rural communities. This project plans to construct ten (10) water supply systems across 10 communities in Mambilla plateau with over 10000 population. The water systems will be constructed at the community health facilities that can also be accessed by the villagers for their household use.</narrative>
  </description>
